\loigiai{
$\left(- 4 x - 7\right)^{2} - \left(12 x - 1\right)^{2}= 3 x^{2} + x - 1368$\\
$- 128 x^{2} + 80 x + 48= 3 x^{2} + x - 1368$\\
$- 131 x^{2} + 79 x + 1416=0$\\
$- \left(x + 3\right) \left(131 x - 472\right)=0$\\
