Vậy $P= \dfrac { 3x_{1}}{ x_{2}}+\dfrac { 3x_{2}}{ x_{1}}  =3\cdot \dfrac {x_{1}^{2} + x_{2}^{2} }{x_{1} \cdot x_{2}} = \dfrac{13}{2}$
}\end{ex}

